Zander Demo spent fifteen years running operations in building services, finishing as Operations Director at Harlow & Pike where he grew the HVAC division from £4.2m to £11.8m in five years. He now coaches MDs and owners of M&E, HVAC and electrical contracting businesses who are winning work but losing margin, and who can't step back because everything still runs through them.

