### The game plan

1. **Step 1 - Get proper visibility on where the margin is going.** Say this: 'The first thing we do is get into the numbers on your live and recently closed jobs - not the year-end accounts, the job-level detail. We build a simple weekly rhythm: which contracts are tracking to margin, which are running over, and exactly where the bleed is coming from. Variations not claimed, subbies running over, materials creeping. I've done this inside a building services business, so I know what to look for and I can get into a job review with you from week one. Most of the time, within the first four to six weeks, we find where the money's going. That changes everything, because once you can see it in real time you can fix it before the dust settles.' Check-in: 'Does that match the kind of visibility you feel you're missing right now?'
