- **Name:** The Building Services Margin Letter
- **Who it is for:** MDs and owners of M&E, HVAC and electrical contracting firms turning over £2m to £12m, typically 15 to 40 staff, winning decent work but watching profit fall short
- **How often:** Monthly
- **Format:** LinkedIn newsletter and email. Under 500 words. One idea, one story or example, one practical action, one offer.
